    {
      "id": "imperfect",
      "topic": "verbs",
      "title": "Imperfect tense: amābam",
      "body": "The imperfect describes ongoing, repeated or habitual action in the past: was doing, used to do. Add -bā- and the personal endings (-m for I).",
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "Person",
